  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Eastern Sea’s merman force has three leaders, all mermaid immortals: Lian Ke Xin, Yu Zi, and Xie Ning Si. At the banquet for Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch she snorts that more than ten Gu Immortals and Immortal Gu House Floating Reputation Boat are not entirely Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s credit. When the three refuse to stake their race on a dangerous bet, she brightens and names a great expert then at Gu tribe headquarters who might help and even win against Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch.",
      "chapters": [
        1979
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_lian_ke_xin",
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_floating_reputation_boat",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_gu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lian Ke Xin grasps her hand to console her after the mermaid group meets Fang Yuan. Narration restates that Lian Ke Xin, Yu Zi, and Xie Ning Si are the three leaders of the Merman Imperial Court, and that the court cannot refuse when Fang Yuan moves some of them into the sovereign immortal aperture. Yu Zi is one of the leaders sent this time and the one who most advocated contributing everything and using beauty to get closer to Fang Yuan. After hearing that Miao Yin is only on rotation, she retargets Fang Yuan’s clones inside the aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        2241
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sent-into-the-aperture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_merman_imperial_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Watching multi-race harmony in the sovereign immortal aperture, she mutters that maybe this is their true homeland. After nine days settling merfolk mortals, the mermaid immortals decide she will stay in that sea area and create the ecology for a stable food source.",
      "chapters": [
        2243
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "homeland-and-ecology",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mermaid immortal Yu Zi looks pale after finishing a flying sand tunnel resource point. Rockman Gu Immortal Shi San Bai thanks her and says she specializes in water path, so setting up an earth path resource point is hard on her. Narration states she is a rank seven Gu Immortal. She took the mission to meet Wu Shuai and seek fiancée status so the merman race’s standing would stabilize.",
      "chapters": [
        2254
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-path-mission",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_mermen",
        "char_shi_san_bai",
        "char_wu_shuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Defending an earth vein node alone, she fails to stop a surge of flying stones, then meets Meng Qiu Zhen. Dream path mold grows on her hair with a rotten stench after she exchanged for Immortal Gu; she pleads for help and he restores her with pink light.",
      "chapters": [
        2256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hair-affliction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen",
        "path_dream",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With a pale face and heavy eye bags she enters Star Collection City in a daze. Another Gu Immortal greets her as Fairy Yu Zi. Lian Ke Xin sends her to Liver Life Hall. Inside, her liver explodes from dao marks, and Fang Yuan’s will offers treatment plans; she chooses a salt water liver transplant.",
      "chapters": [
        2257
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "liver-life-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_collection_city",
        "house_liver_life"
      ]
    }
  ],
